<!--
    Deployment package for SAP Variant Configuration integration.

    Includes:
      - CPQExternalConfiguratorController          : Global webservice facade used by the VF page and CPQ
      - CPQExtConfigurator_PricingTest : Apex unit tests for pricing controller
      - SAPVcProductConfigurationService           : Service layer for all SAP VC Product Configuration callouts
      - CPQExternalConfiguratorControllerPoC       : Legacy PoC controller (kept for reference)
      - VcpConfigManagerController                 : @AuraEnabled facade for LWC
      - VcpConfigManagerController_Test            : Apex unit tests for LWC controller

      - Visualforce pages:
        * CPQExternalConfiguratorTabs    : Dev/test VF page — main external configurator UI
        * CPQExternalConfiguratorTabsPoC : Legacy PoC VF page

      - Lightning Web Components (LWC):
        * utilActivityLog          : Reusable dark-terminal activity log with collapsible JSON rows,
                                     status code badges and copy-to-clipboard. Accepts @api entries[].
        * vcpProductSelector       : LWC entry point — product search/filter list, launches vcpConfigManager
        * vcpConfigManager         : LWC configurator — KB determination + characteristics form
                                     Supports 3 display modes: Form / Wizard / Tabs (selected via View buttons)
        * vcpCharacteristicsForm       : LWC child — Form mode: flat grid of all characteristics
        * vcpCharacteristicsWizard     : LWC child — Wizard mode: one characteristic at a time with progress bar
        * vcpCharacteristicsGroupTabs  : LWC child — Tabs mode: one lightning-tab per characteristicGroup (from KB)
                                         Group order and membership come from GET /knowledgebases/{id}/translations
                                         (products[0].characteristicGroups[].characteristicIDs).
                                         The group layout is cached in groupOrderCache on first KB translation load,
                                         so Tabs mode keeps showing groups even after switching back to API mode.

      - Quick Actions:
        * SBQQ__Quote__c.VCP_Add_Product : Quote action to launch the VCP product flow

      - Permission Sets:
        * SAP_VariantConfiguration_Agent : Grants class + external credential access

      - Static Resources:
        * countriesIcons                         : Flag PNG images (16x18px) for language selector
        * VC_CPQ_Mocks                           : Zip folder — mock API responses (reference copy)
        * vcp_kb_determination_success           : GET /api/v2/kbdetermination mock
        * vcp_kb_translations_success            : GET /api/v2/knowledgebases/{id}/translations mock
        * vcp_kb_translations_characteristics_success : GET .../translations?$select=characteristics mock
        * vcp_configuration_create_success       : POST /api/v2/configurations mock
        * vcp_configuration_get_success          : GET /api/v2/configurations/{id} mock
        * vcp_configuration_patch_success        : PATCH /api/v2/configurations/{id} mock
        * vcp_pricing_calculate_success          : POST /api/v1/pricing/documents mock
        * vcp_error_401_unauthorized             : 401 error response mock
        * vcp_error_412_etag_mismatch            : 412 ETag mismatch error mock

    Deploy command (from workspace root):
      sf project deploy start --manifest manifest/package-sap-vc-deploy.xml --target-org <alias>

    Retrieve command:
      sf project retrieve start --manifest manifest/package-sap-vc-deploy.xml --target-org <alias>
-->
